    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="80f49dcc-9178-5651-99f1-672551a11dbb" activityNameId="f28c1fa1-e66f-51c5-bb94-6ee166856177" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pellets, burned in cogen 300kWth</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pellets, burned in cogen 300kWth
Inventory for 1 MJ pellets, burned in a cogeneration plant with a capacity of 30 kWth. This inventory reflects the unallocated process of burning natural gas in a cogen unit with all necessary inputs and emissions. Efficiency of the cogen unit as well allocation is not yet considered;
UUID: 8989bd45-7cfb-3255-8cde-82fdf8e46f79
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (cogeneration plant), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8989bd45-7cfb-3255-8cde-82fdf8e46f79.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
